  "w1_w2_camera_places": "Settled with the shot checker (round 3), four ways: (A) the pavement's middle, 1.1 m from the house fronts, gates 7 m apart: 12 problems in W1 and 4 in W2, the lines meeting on the gate (0.004 away), nothing past the phone buttons; (B) gates moved 0.9 m toward the lane's middle, camera in line with the outer pier: 15 and 5, the queue's nearest man past 0.95 across; (C) gates moved 0.5 m: 15 and 5, the same, the lantern hidden; (D) the first plan's spot in line with the outer pier, 0.2 m from the house fronts: inside the bank's bay window, everything hidden. Kept: (A).",
